Inspect reviewed collection coverage and exclusions for all pinned AWS schemas

Usage: aws-inventory coverage [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --service <SERVICE>      Match either the CloudFormation family or its normalized service name
      --type-name <TYPE_NAME>  
      --unselected             Include only types that are not in the executable catalog
      --limit <LIMIT>          [default: 200]
  -h, --help                   Print help
